"The program '%1' tried to call a function which is not implemented or attempted "
"to access an external resource which does not exist."
msgstr "『%1』程式嘗試呼叫一個未有實作的函數、或企圖存取不存在的外部資源。"

#: common/newsengine.cpp:270
msgid ""
"The program '%1' was unable to retrieve input data and was therefore unable to "
"return any XML data."
msgstr "『%1』程式無法取回輸入資料，因此無法傳回任何 XML 資料。"

#: common/newsengine.cpp:272
msgid ""
"The program '%1' tried to access a host which is not connected to a network."
msgstr "『%1』程式嘗試存取沒有連到網絡的主機。"

#: common/newsengine.cpp:274
msgid "The program '%1' tried to access a protocol which is not implemented."
msgstr "『%1』程式嘗試存取未有實作的通訊協定。"

#: common/newsengine.cpp:276
msgid ""
"The program '%1' requires you to configure a destination address to retrieve "
"data from. Please refer to the documentation of the program for information on "
"how to do that."
msgstr "『%1』程式要求您設定要取得的資料的目標位址。請查閱程式文件瞭解如何進行。"

#: common/newsengine.cpp:279
msgid ""
"The program '%1' tried to use a socket type which is not supported by this "
"system."
msgstr "『%1』程式嘗試使用系統不支援的 socket 類型。"

#: common/newsengine.cpp:281
msgid "The program '%1' tried to access an unreachable network."
msgstr "『%1』不被此嘗試存取無法到達的網路。"

#: common/newsengine.cpp:283
msgid ""
"The network the program '%1' was trying to access dropped the connection with a "
"reset."
msgstr "『%1』程式嘗試存取被中斷並重置的連線。"

#: common/newsengine.cpp:285
msgid "The connection of the program '%1' was reset by peer."
msgstr "『%1』程式的連線已被對方重置。"

#: common/newsengine.cpp:287
msgid "The connection the program '%1' was trying to establish timed out."
msgstr "『%1』程式嘗試建立的連線逾時。"

#: common/newsengine.cpp:289
msgid "The connection the program '%1' was trying to establish was refused."
msgstr "『%1』程式嘗試建立的連線被拒絕。"

#: common/newsengine.cpp:291
msgid "The host the program '%1' was trying to reach is down."
msgstr "『%1』程式嘗試聯繫的主機已停止。"

#: common/newsengine.cpp:293
msgid ""
"The host the program '%1' was trying to reach is unreachable, no route to host."
msgstr "『%1』程式嘗試聯繫的主機無法到達，沒有到達該主機的路由。"

#: common/newsengine.cpp:295
msgid ""
"KNewsTicker could not execute the program '%1' because its executable bit was "
"not set. You can mark that program as executable by executing the following "
"steps:"
"<ul>"
"<li>Open a Konqueror window and browse to the program</li>"
"<li>Click on the file with the right mouse button, and select 'Properties'</li>"
"<li>Open the 'Permissions' tab and make sure that the box in the column 'Exec' "
"and the row 'User' is checked to ensure that the current user is allowed to "
"execute that file.</li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"K新聞快報無法執行『%1』程式，因為它的可執行位元未有設定。你可以下列步驟將程式標示為可執行："
"<ul>"
"<li>開啟 Konqueror 視窗並瀏覽至此程式</li>"
"<li>用滑鼠右鍵點擊此檔案，然後選擇『屬性』</li>"
"<li>打開『權限』的標籤，並在『擁有者』列勾選『執行』，以允許目前的使用者可以執行此檔。</li></ul>"

#: common/newsengine.cpp:303
msgid ""
"The program '%1' sent a bad request which was not understood by the server."
msgstr "『%1』程式送出有問題的請求，伺服器無法了解。"

#: common/newsengine.cpp:305
msgid ""
"The program '%1' failed to issue an authorization for an area which needs some "
"form of authorization before it can be accessed."
msgstr "『%1』程式在需要授權才能存取的區域未能發出授權。"

#: common/newsengine.cpp:308
msgid ""
"The program '%1' aborted because it could not access the data without paying "
"for it."
msgstr "『%1』程式中止，因為無法存取資料。"

#: common/newsengine.cpp:310
msgid "The program '%1' tried to access a forbidden source."
msgstr "『%1』程式嘗試存取被禁止的來源。"

#: common/newsengine.cpp:312
msgid "The program '%1' tried to access data which could not be found."
msgstr "『%1』程式嘗試存取無法找到的資料。"

#: common/newsengine.cpp:314
msgid "The HTTP request of the program '%1' timed out."
msgstr "『%1』程式的 HTTP 請求已逾時。"

#: common/newsengine.cpp:315
msgid ""
"A server error has been encountered. It is likely that you cannot do anything "
"about it."
msgstr "伺服器遇到錯誤。看來你無法解決這個問題。"

#: common/newsengine.cpp:317
msgid ""
"The HTTP protocol version used by the program '%1' was not understood by the "
"HTTP server or source."
msgstr "『%1』程式所使用的 HTTP 協定版本無法被 HTTP 伺服器或來源了解。"

#: common/newsengine.cpp:319
msgid "KNewsTicker was unable to detect the exact reasons for the error."
msgstr "K新聞快報無法偵測錯誤的精確原因。"

#: knewstickerstub/knewstickerstub.cpp:23
msgid "KNewsTickerStub"
msgstr "K新聞快報末端"

#: knewstickerstub/knewstickerstub.cpp:25
msgid "A frontend to the KNewsTicker configuration"
msgstr "K新聞快報設定的前端介面"

